Christian,

Unfortunately the btsco module is not seeing a lot of work lately.

If you want to help eliminate some possible problems, build it with
these lines disabled:

/* enable dynamic compression */
#define DYNAMIC_COMPRESSION
/* enable automatic endianness fixup */
#define AUTO_FIXUP_BYTESHIFT

That's about the only thing that we have changed in several months. (The
kernel's module API is changing all the time but that's another matter)

Brad

